@fact bram.prefect
# en: A prefect of your own year, with a red sash, a ledger of demerits and a fondness for your name.
text [6bfca0] = 和你同年级的级长，系着红绶带，揣着一本记过簿，特别喜欢往上写你的名字。

@fact bram.father
# en: His father was head boy, and has told Bram all his life that he will never amount to anything.
text [414950] = 他父亲当年是男生学生会主席，一辈子都在告诉布拉姆他不会有出息。
# en: Someone's opinion weighs on him more than any rule.
hint [2f9e41] = 有个人的看法，比任何校规都压得他喘不过气。

@fact bram.hall_tax
# en: He once invented a "hall tax" for the east staircase.
text [67e9e9] = 他曾为东侧楼梯发明过一项“走廊税”。
# en: Ask about the east staircase.
hint [6d48c6] = 问问东侧楼梯的事。

@fact bram.cheating
# en: You saw him cheat in an exam. He knows you saw.
text [2e1460] = 你看见他考试作弊。他知道你看见了。
# en: Prefects sit exams too.
hint [72526b] = 级长也是要考试的。

@fact bram.ally
# en: Under the sash, he will step between you and trouble. Then he tells you not to make it weird.
text [e7ac5a] = 在那条绶带底下，他会挡在你和麻烦之间。然后叫你别把气氛搞得奇怪。
# en: Under the sash, there may be someone else.
hint [48a6c4] = 那条级长绶带底下，也许是另一个人。

@fact bram.portrait
# en: His father's portrait hangs in the corridor of head boys. Every visit, his father stops in front of it, and then looks at Bram.
text [f58601] = 他父亲的肖像挂在历届男生代表的走廊里。每次来访，他父亲都会在它面前停下，然后看向布拉姆。
# en: Walk the corridor of head boys with him.
hint [afb801] = 陪他走一趟历届男学生会长的画像长廊。

@fact bram.rematch
# en: When he loses, he practises alone on the duelling green every evening for a month, and then asks for a rematch.
text [f1ee7c] = 他一输，就会每天晚上独自在决斗草坪上练一个月，然后要求再比一场。
# en: Beat him at something he cares about.
hint [89661e] = 在他在乎的事上赢他一次。
